{"version":1,"key":"card:121","content":{"id":121,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"getopts","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 用于 shell 脚本中，它一次处理一个命令行选项，当处理完所有选项后，会返回大于 0 的退出码"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"getopts optstring var","language":"bash","uuid":"3b20b4d1-4f30-4433-9673-85f3fb9b4e6e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"optstring","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的定义同 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"getopt","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"#!/bin/zsh\nwhile getopts :ab:cd var\ndo\n\tcase \"$var\" in\n\t\ta)\n\t\t\techo \"$var opt\";;\n\t\tb)\n\t\t\techo \"$var opt with param $OPTARG\";;\n\t\tc)\n\t\t\techo \"$var opt\";;\n\t\td)\n\t\t\techo \"$var opt\";;\n\t\t*)\n\t\t\techo \"unknown $var\";;\n\tesac\ndone\n\nshift $[ $OPTIND - 1 ]\n\nfor param in \"$@\"\ndo\n\techo \"param: $param\"\ndone","language":"bash","uuid":"4e6c7a9d-b175-4e58-b5e3-6aa186af0b7f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果选项带有参数，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"$OPTARG","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 全局变量取得"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"getopts","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 读取到的选项"},{"type":"formatted","text":"没有","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" "},{"type":"formatted","text":"-","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"getopts","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会自动去掉 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"--","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，不用手动处理 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"--","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"处理完"},{"type":"formatted","text":"选项","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"后 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"getopts","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会自动退出，接下来可以处理参数"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"$OPTIND","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 获得 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"getopts","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 处理到哪个位置了，调用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"shift","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，然后处理参数"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参数中可以包含空格 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"\"t3 t4\"","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"未定义的选项，如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"e","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，统一处理为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"?","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不显示错误信息，在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"optstring","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 前加上 "},{"type":"formatted","text":":","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":":ab:cd","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"xt in ~/shell/read λ ./getopts.sh -ab t1 -cde t1 \"t2 t3\"\na opt\nb opt with param t1\nc opt\nd opt\nunknown ?\nparam: t1\nparam: t2 t3","language":"bash","uuid":"fa142931-25ab-4545-9a59-d717c4a8e1a7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Shell编程"],"createTime":1689257362036,"updateTime":1758084782361,"linkedCards":[{"id":112,"target":{"key":"card:112","type":"card","id":112},"summary":"shift 可以移动变量，默认移动一步，将 $2 移动到 $1 ， $1 的值会被丢弃，所以请小心 #!/bin/zsh while [ -n \"$1\" ] do echo \"$1\" shift done xt in ~/shell/rea...","tags":["Shell编程"]},{"id":120,"target":{"key":"card:120","type":"card","id":120},"summary":"getopt 可以格式化命令行选项， getopt optstring parameters ， optstring 定义选项字符串，带有参数的选项后面加上 : ，如 ab:cd xt in ~/shell/read λ getopt ab...","tags":["Shell编程"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1758084782361}}